{
  "name": "dsh-memo",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "给自己的备忘录做一组查询接口：按目录 / 按节 / 全文搜索 / 项目卡 / 速查表 / 套路 / 追加，一次几百 token 就能查到事实，不用把整份 MEMO.md 读进上下文。右上角面板能看到每次查询的时间、参数、命中、返回大小与节省比例。",
  "meta": {
    "title": "(工具)备忘录",
    "description": "按需查 MEMO.md：目录、按节、搜索、项目卡、速查表；右上角面板显示每次查询用了多少 token、省了多少。"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "icon.svg"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "memo",
    "notes",
    "knowledge-base"
  ],
  "author": "@奇迹与你",
  "license": "MIT"
}
